1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:02,190
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations,
professions, or events shown in the series

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:03,460
are entirely fictional,
solely for the purpose of entertainment,

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,730
with no intention to instruct
or promote any kind of behavior;

4
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:06,000
viewer discretion is advised]

5
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:09,470
If you still want to capture Krating...

6
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:11,100
Master In's daughter...

7
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,170
Who is she?

8
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,390
Master Bulan.

9
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,710
If you do not...

10
00:00:14,730 --> 00:00:16,310
come before me tonight,

11
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:17,600
do not expect...

12
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,680
a peaceful slumber.

13
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,500
I have to go home with the bullets,

14
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,570
no matter what it takes.

15
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,280
Could you have me

16
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,400
transferred to Phop Phra?

17
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:39,480
Yes, Dad.

18
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,420
I've had a talk with them.

19
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,130
Go ahead and report yourself.

20
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:44,600
As for the documents,

21
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:46,010
I'll forward them later.

22
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,530
Thank you, Dad.

23
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:48,970
Right,

24
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Dad.

25
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:51,530
If...

26
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,610
I need your help with something,

27
00:00:54,630 --> 00:00:55,690
would that be possible?

28
00:00:56,310 --> 00:00:57,690
If it's about Mom,

29
00:00:57,710 --> 00:00:59,260
don't worry at all, Peem.

30
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:00,880
I'll take care of it.

31
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:01,680
Alright.

32
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:05,500
I just don't want to be
another one of Mom's worries.

33
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:07,300
What happened to Phu...

34
00:01:07,670 --> 00:01:09,990
has already caused her enough sorrow.

35
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:11,900
Peem, my dear,

36
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,180
whatever you have in mind,

37
00:01:14,220 --> 00:01:16,260
I won't stop you.
[Phop Phra Police Station]

38
00:01:16,310 --> 00:01:17,920
But you have to promise me

39
00:01:18,420 --> 00:01:20,040
you'll take good care of yourself.

40
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,010
Yes,

41
00:01:21,410 --> 00:01:22,700
I promise.

42
00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:33,130
I'll go ahead and introduce her.

43
00:01:33,620 --> 00:01:36,080
This is Police Lieutenant Phitcha Ruechakun.

44
00:01:36,670 --> 00:01:38,610
She's a detective from Bangkok.

45
00:01:40,370 --> 00:01:42,560
You can call me "Peem."

46
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,110
I'll be temporarily stationed here

47
00:01:45,250 --> 00:01:47,520
to investigate a human trafficking case.

48
00:01:47,980 --> 00:01:51,390
And if the clues align with
the intelligence I've received,

49
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:55,160
the suspect might be using
the international border

50
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:58,680
to transport the victims
to neighboring countries.

51
00:01:59,310 --> 00:02:02,390
I'm not here only to help the victims,

52
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:04,400
but I'm here...

53
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:07,410
to eradicate the ones responsible,

54
00:02:07,710 --> 00:02:09,700
no matter where they might be hiding.

55
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:15,420
Anyway...

56
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:17,500
please take care of me.

57
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:21,710
We can take care of your heart, too.

58
00:02:24,780 --> 00:02:26,490
Your wife's gonna come
cuss you out again, Sarge.

59
00:02:26,890 --> 00:02:29,390
That day when you were seeing
that watermelon vendor lady,

60
00:02:29,410 --> 00:02:30,530
I heard you still haven't sorted things out.

61
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,520
Jeez...

62
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:34,320
I was just being playful, Chief.

63
00:02:34,620 --> 00:02:35,760
I love my family

64
00:02:35,780 --> 00:02:36,810
just as much as you love yours.

65
00:02:37,290 --> 00:02:38,890
Don't hold it against him, Lieutenant.

66
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:41,720
If you have any questions,
ask the sergeant.

67
00:02:42,340 --> 00:02:45,040
He's been married and settled here
for more than a decade.

68
00:02:45,460 --> 00:02:47,160
He also transferred here,
just like you did.

69
00:02:48,210 --> 00:02:50,760
Yes, and I found love here at Phop Phra.

70
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:52,200
That's that.

71
00:02:52,510 --> 00:02:55,200
If there's something you wanna know
or anywhere you wanna go,

72
00:02:55,780 --> 00:02:56,920
ask him.

73
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:58,800
Yes, sir.

74
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:01,700
Our sub-district here is small,

75
00:03:01,730 --> 00:03:03,370
nowhere near as busy as Bangkok.

76
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:06,590
Someone as skilled as you

77
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:09,040
will adapt in no time.

78
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:12,710
As for the case that brought you here,

79
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:15,090
I would like you to be very careful.

80
00:03:15,990 --> 00:03:18,710
Every area has its own etiquette,

81
00:03:19,620 --> 00:03:22,500
especially when it comes to
matters related to neighboring countries,

82
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,640
which are even more sensitive.

83
00:03:24,110 --> 00:03:25,410
I hope you understand.

84
00:03:26,210 --> 00:03:27,080
Yes,

85
00:03:27,310 --> 00:03:28,310
I understand.

86
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:31,300
More importantly,
your father instructed me

87
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:32,280
to take good care of you.

88
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,900
So, don't put yourself in danger.

89
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:38,380
I am here to work on a case.

90
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:41,400
There's no need for you
to give me special treatment.

91
00:03:42,230 --> 00:03:44,760
I just don't want to have
any problems with your parents.

92
00:03:45,750 --> 00:03:48,370
Anyway, if you find out anything,
report it to me first.

93
00:03:50,180 --> 00:03:52,010
Do not act on your own.

94
00:03:53,650 --> 00:03:54,610
This is an order.

95
00:03:55,310 --> 00:03:56,360
Understood?

96
00:03:58,690 --> 00:03:59,490
Yes, sir.

97
00:04:01,710 --> 00:04:03,480
Then, get back to work.

98
00:04:03,500 --> 00:04:04,390
Yes, sir.

99
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,370
Yes, sir.

100
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:10,770
Sarge.

101
00:04:11,110 --> 00:04:11,810
Yes?

102
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:14,040
Show the lieutenant her desk.

103
00:04:14,410 --> 00:04:15,410
Yes, sir!

104
00:04:16,130 --> 00:04:16,900
This way, Lieutenant.

105
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:40,160
♫Along with ghostly spirits
hounding relentlessly,♫

106
00:04:40,180 --> 00:04:44,900
♫May the maras be ravaged
and perish completely♫

107
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:49,080
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

108
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:53,420
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

109
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:57,820
♫Were any souls to brush
against my karmic soulmate,♫

110
00:04:57,870 --> 00:05:02,530
♫They shall bury the thought
of returning to their realm♫

111
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:06,580
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

112
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:11,050
♫At my feet,
they shall surrender and kneel,♫

113
00:05:11,070 --> 00:05:16,130
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

114
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:46,090
This is the desk
for our beautiful lieutenant.

115
00:05:47,710 --> 00:05:48,590
Peace and quiet,

116
00:05:48,810 --> 00:05:49,880
but not private.

117
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:53,700
You don't have to call me
"Beautiful Lieutenant."

118
00:05:53,810 --> 00:05:56,290
Just "Lieutenant Peem" is fine.

119
00:05:56,710 --> 00:05:57,710
Copy.

120
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:02,080
Oh!

121
00:06:02,100 --> 00:06:03,100
Uh...

122
00:06:03,230 --> 00:06:05,360
I'm going on patrol this afternoon.

123
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,490
If you're interested...

124
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:07,290
after lunch,

125
00:06:07,310 --> 00:06:08,310
meet me downstairs.

126
00:06:09,910 --> 00:06:10,450
Alright, Sarge.

127
00:06:10,470 --> 00:06:11,220
Alright.

128
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:13,300
Make yourself comfortable, Sarge.

129
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:14,520
- Yes.
- Don't be nervous.

130
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:15,410
Alright.

131
00:06:15,430 --> 00:06:16,610
Oh, my, it's so hot.

132
00:06:16,820 --> 00:06:18,290
That looks delicious, Sarge.

133
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,380
I haven't eaten it yet.

134
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:21,190
Your table's full.

135
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,920
Hello.

136
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:40,840
What is Master doing here?

137
00:07:41,130 --> 00:07:42,500
I've only seen her
at major merit-making ceremonies.

138
00:07:59,610 --> 00:08:00,220
Sarge.

139
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:00,870
Yes?

140
00:08:00,890 --> 00:08:03,000
Welcome Master for me, okay?

141
00:08:03,300 --> 00:08:04,710
Get her some water, too.

142
00:08:04,910 --> 00:08:05,500
Yes, sir.

143
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:06,470
I have to take care
of something real quick.

144
00:08:06,490 --> 00:08:07,050
Alright.

145
00:08:15,230 --> 00:08:16,000
Sarge,

146
00:08:16,710 --> 00:08:17,710
I'll give this to her myself.

147
00:08:17,730 --> 00:08:18,200
Alright.

148
00:08:18,220 --> 00:08:19,300
- Thank you.
- Of course.

149
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:24,800
Why didn't you close it properly?

150
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:26,400
That's careless of you.

151
00:08:35,730 --> 00:08:37,880
You came here to see me?

152
00:08:41,350 --> 00:08:42,610
Could it be that...

153
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:45,160
you've decided
to help me with the bullets?

154
00:08:45,340 --> 00:08:47,600
I made you breakfast,

155
00:08:48,130 --> 00:08:50,630
but you left in such haste
without eating it.

156
00:08:51,700 --> 00:08:54,510
So I have prepared
lunch for you in a tiffin.

157
00:09:01,500 --> 00:09:02,500
In this tiffin...

158
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:04,020
there is roasted laab

159
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:08,100
and kaeng hang ley with pork.

160
00:09:08,740 --> 00:09:11,000
I do not know what food you favor,

161
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:12,850
so I brought everything I had made.

162
00:09:13,300 --> 00:09:15,330
You came all the way here
just because of this?

163
00:09:20,710 --> 00:09:22,200
I made this especially for you.

164
00:09:23,540 --> 00:09:25,890
You know how serious I am about this.

165
00:09:26,730 --> 00:09:29,750
My little brother is at death's door,

166
00:09:29,770 --> 00:09:31,320
lying in a hospital bed,

167
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,960
but you're treating this
like some kind of joke.

168
00:09:35,710 --> 00:09:37,590
If you don't intend to help,

169
00:09:37,870 --> 00:09:40,310
please stop messing with my head.

170
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,610
Do I look like

171
00:09:43,230 --> 00:09:45,320
I am here to play?

172
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:48,710
If I truly did not intend to help,

173
00:09:48,730 --> 00:09:51,210
then why did I close
the sanctum to come see you?

174
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:55,650
Forget me messing with your head.

175
00:09:56,090 --> 00:09:58,300
The restless spirits
hounding you all the way here

176
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,790
might soon madden you

177
00:09:59,810 --> 00:10:01,350
into oblivion.

178
00:10:02,220 --> 00:10:04,280
I have never regarded this
as a debt of gratitude.

179
00:10:04,570 --> 00:10:07,090
Had you not been someone
I yearn for so deeply,

180
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:10,360
you, cocky officer,
would never set foot in my sanctum.

181
00:10:16,110 --> 00:10:18,700
I made these dishes for you,

182
00:10:19,500 --> 00:10:21,450
but if you do not care for them,

183
00:10:21,500 --> 00:10:22,910
throw them away.

184
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:30,810
So, as long as I eat it, that's enough?

185
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,210
Fine.

186
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,040
Okay.

187
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,130
I ate it.

188
00:10:57,490 --> 00:10:58,750
Happy?

189
00:11:02,430 --> 00:11:03,790
Is it not to your taste?

190
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:05,930
I'm full.

191
00:11:06,510 --> 00:11:08,800
I don't eat breakfast

192
00:11:08,830 --> 00:11:11,000
or a heavy meal for lunch.

193
00:11:11,210 --> 00:11:12,600
I don't eat again...

194
00:11:12,620 --> 00:11:13,690
until dinner.

195
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:15,160
Besides,

196
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:18,020
I'm not in the mood to eat in peace.

197
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,510
If you do not force yourself to eat,

198
00:11:21,530 --> 00:11:23,420
how will you have
the strength to arrest criminals?

199
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:25,810
It's not anyone's concern.

200
00:11:31,540 --> 00:11:32,570
Master,

201
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:34,800
please come this way.

202
00:12:01,810 --> 00:12:02,810
Lieutenant,

203
00:12:02,980 --> 00:12:04,390
these are the files for the local case.

204
00:12:04,710 --> 00:12:05,710
Yes, Sarge.

205
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:09,720
Whoa...

206
00:12:11,510 --> 00:12:12,610
Didn't you say you were gonna eat

207
00:12:13,300 --> 00:12:14,550
when you go on patrol?

208
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:22,110
Where is she, Lieutenant?

209
00:12:22,750 --> 00:12:23,690
Has she already left?

210
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:26,610
What do you mean, Sarge?

211
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:28,390
Well, your girlfriend, of course.

212
00:12:29,700 --> 00:12:31,590
What girlfriend, Sarge?

213
00:12:32,410 --> 00:12:33,920
I am single.

214
00:12:34,030 --> 00:12:35,090
Don't, Lieutenant.

215
00:12:35,340 --> 00:12:36,600
I'm eagle-eyed.

216
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:39,240
Nothing escapes my sight.

217
00:12:40,350 --> 00:12:43,240
You should put
those skills to use at work, Sarge.

218
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:44,100
Aha.

219
00:12:44,220 --> 00:12:46,360
Not on my personal matters.

220
00:12:46,380 --> 00:12:47,000
Aha.

221
00:12:48,460 --> 00:12:49,600
Sharp-tongued.

222
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:51,810
No wonder you're from Bangkok.

223
00:12:54,460 --> 00:12:55,280
By the way,

224
00:12:55,300 --> 00:12:57,130
you know Master?

225
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,480
I saw you talking in the chief's room.

226
00:13:02,520 --> 00:13:03,410
Sarge,

227
00:13:03,430 --> 00:13:05,000
you asked me to go on patrol?

228
00:13:05,270 --> 00:13:05,820
Yes.

229
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,770
Come on, let's go.

230
00:13:06,790 --> 00:13:07,170
Let's go.

231
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:07,980
By the way,

232
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:10,240
where's the restroom at this station?

233
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:13,680
I want to change
into something more flexible.

234
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:14,910
Over there.

235
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:17,320
There's a clean one and a not-so-clean one.

236
00:13:17,660 --> 00:13:18,570
Anything will do.

237
00:13:18,750 --> 00:13:19,670
Come on, Sarge.

238
00:13:19,690 --> 00:13:20,320
We're wasting our time.

239
00:13:20,340 --> 00:13:21,890
There's the suspect's shit, too.

240
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:23,290
And mine.

241
00:13:24,190 --> 00:13:25,470
What a load of BS, Sarge.

242
00:13:25,500 --> 00:13:26,500
Yes, ma'am.

243
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:33,120
This area borders Myanmar,

244
00:13:33,660 --> 00:13:35,120
Phop Phra included.

245
00:13:35,140 --> 00:13:36,840
People here come from
diverse ethnic backgrounds.

246
00:13:36,940 --> 00:13:37,960
They're Thai,

247
00:13:37,980 --> 00:13:39,120
Bamar, Karen,

248
00:13:39,140 --> 00:13:40,190
S'gaw Karen,

249
00:13:40,950 --> 00:13:41,900
Haw Chinese,

250
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,290
Akha,

251
00:13:43,650 --> 00:13:44,510
and Hmong.

252
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:46,680
There are also
the dark arts and black magic.

253
00:13:47,690 --> 00:13:48,710
There are Northeasterners here, too.

254
00:13:50,620 --> 00:13:51,600
Eat up, Lieutenant.

255
00:13:55,510 --> 00:13:56,870
It's really delicious, Sarge.

256
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:58,700
Chai!

257
00:13:59,010 --> 00:14:00,010
Long time no see.

258
00:14:00,380 --> 00:14:01,280
You're getting chubbier.

259
00:14:01,370 --> 00:14:02,540
Well, I've made a bit of money.

260
00:14:02,750 --> 00:14:05,090
I've been doing business
on the other side.

261
00:14:05,310 --> 00:14:05,960
Here you go.

262
00:14:06,620 --> 00:14:07,620
Take some.

263
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:09,820
Ever heard of them?

264
00:14:09,940 --> 00:14:11,320
Sengphae and halawa.

265
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:13,130
I've heard of them, but never tried them.

266
00:14:13,150 --> 00:14:15,360
They taste like our khanom krok.

267
00:14:15,380 --> 00:14:16,540
Sengphae is made with glutinous rice,

268
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:17,890
while halawa is made with rice.

269
00:14:17,910 --> 00:14:19,650
They're hard to come by.
I'm giving you some.

270
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:20,900
Try them for me.

271
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:23,660
And...

272
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:25,440
share some with this sugar.

273
00:14:26,260 --> 00:14:27,150
Whoa, whoa.

274
00:14:27,170 --> 00:14:28,440
She's a new officer at the station.

275
00:14:29,390 --> 00:14:30,800
You're making me look bad.

276
00:14:30,950 --> 00:14:32,150
Go. Run along now.

277
00:14:32,290 --> 00:14:33,500
Fine, I'm going.

278
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:35,900
Let's meet up and drink sometime, Sarge.

279
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:37,320
Uh-uh, not drinking.

280
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:39,030
Lieutenant.

281
00:14:41,850 --> 00:14:42,850
Go ahead, Sarge.

282
00:14:43,060 --> 00:14:45,200
I don't really eat desserts.

283
00:14:53,730 --> 00:14:55,190
What did...

284
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:56,620
you just do?

285
00:14:56,900 --> 00:15:00,150
Sarge, why did you pass the dessert
between your legs?

286
00:15:00,790 --> 00:15:03,440
I've already told you
that no one can be trusted here.

287
00:15:03,890 --> 00:15:05,520
There are both magic and the dark arts.

288
00:15:06,850 --> 00:15:08,410
This is what you do to ward it off.

289
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:45,670
Sarge.

290
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:46,600
Sarge!

291
00:15:48,230 --> 00:15:48,900
Sarge!

292
00:15:49,210 --> 00:15:50,460
This isn't funny, Sarge!

293
00:15:51,460 --> 00:15:52,290
Sarge!

294
00:15:52,390 --> 00:15:53,800
It's so good
my eyes roll back, Lieutenant.

295
00:15:55,820 --> 00:15:56,380
Look at you,

296
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:57,710
messing around like this.

297
00:15:57,730 --> 00:16:00,180
If this really happened one day,

298
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:01,150
what would you do?

299
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:02,610
Screw it all.

300
00:16:03,550 --> 00:16:05,210
You joke about everything.

301
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:07,020
This is just to break the ice.

302
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,100
Sis!

303
00:16:09,730 --> 00:16:11,630
Someone wants you
to check on your daughter at school.

304
00:16:11,660 --> 00:16:12,790
They're saying that

305
00:16:12,810 --> 00:16:14,110
she's possessed!

306
00:16:16,420 --> 00:16:17,280
Sarge...

307
00:16:19,370 --> 00:16:20,370
Sir, I'll be back to pay.

308
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:26,210
Lieutenant.

309
00:16:37,650 --> 00:16:38,980
Kids, make way.

310
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,070
Make way.

311
00:16:40,650 --> 00:16:41,960
This way, Master.

312
00:16:52,630 --> 00:16:54,380
This brat has desecrated me.

313
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:55,800
I will bring death upon her!

314
00:16:55,900 --> 00:16:56,900
Go.

315
00:16:57,050 --> 00:16:59,210
Do not harm an innocent child.

316
00:16:59,330 --> 00:17:00,460
She did this to me!

317
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:02,080
I will tear her to pieces!

318
00:17:02,100 --> 00:17:03,720
She must die!

319
00:17:04,100 --> 00:17:04,870
Hold her.

320
00:17:04,890 --> 00:17:06,440
If she gets away, it will be dangerous.

321
00:17:06,590 --> 00:17:07,590
Pleng.

322
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:09,090
Pleng, my baby!

323
00:17:09,110 --> 00:17:10,230
Pleng!

324
00:17:10,530 --> 00:17:11,770
Pleng, what's happening to you?!

325
00:17:11,890 --> 00:17:12,960
Pleng, baby!

326
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:14,570
Master!

327
00:17:14,590 --> 00:17:16,530
Pleng took out
a Thai dancer figurine to play with

328
00:17:16,790 --> 00:17:19,190
and...accidentally broke its glass cover

329
00:17:19,210 --> 00:17:21,010
when she put it back.

330
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:31,590
Pleng.

331
00:17:31,620 --> 00:17:33,020
Pleng, dear!

332
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,200
Pleng!

333
00:17:35,390 --> 00:17:36,640
Oh, alas.

334
00:17:36,660 --> 00:17:38,010
Never before have I seen one depart.

335
00:17:38,030 --> 00:17:39,580
Would fallen spirits
triumph over the living?

336
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:41,320
By the sacred power of Namo Buddhaya.

337
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:48,890
What is this, Sarge?

338
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:50,810
It seems...

339
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:52,200
she's possessed;

340
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:53,300
otherwise,

341
00:17:53,710 --> 00:17:55,320
Master wouldn't
have been summoned here.

342
00:17:59,310 --> 00:18:01,810
This doesn't seem right to me, Sarge.

343
00:18:02,500 --> 00:18:03,600
What do you mean?

344
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:05,800
Can't you see she's being possessed?

345
00:18:06,010 --> 00:18:07,610
Master is using a ritual knife

346
00:18:07,630 --> 00:18:08,500
to exorcise it.

347
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,300
See? It's squirming.

348
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:11,360
"Exorcise," my ass!

349
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:14,310
You can clearly see
that the kid's being assaulted!

350
00:18:15,100 --> 00:18:26,740
(Incanting)

351
00:18:26,770 --> 00:18:28,050
- Excuse me.
- Lieutenant! Lieutenant!

352
00:18:28,070 --> 00:18:31,150
(Incanting)

353
00:18:35,940 --> 00:18:36,910
Miss!

354
00:18:36,930 --> 00:18:39,330
Who are you?
Why are you interrupting the ritual?!

355
00:18:39,410 --> 00:18:40,210
What ritual?

356
00:18:40,540 --> 00:18:42,390
You saw that the kid
was convulsing so badly

357
00:18:42,410 --> 00:18:43,970
that she couldn't control herself.

358
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,880
And what kind of teacher are you, huh?

359
00:18:47,010 --> 00:18:48,920
Why didn't you take her to the hospital?!

360
00:18:50,770 --> 00:18:51,680
Goodness!

361
00:18:51,700 --> 00:18:53,110
Argh! My heart is bursting!

362
00:18:53,340 --> 00:18:54,790
Are you out of your mind?!

363
00:18:54,810 --> 00:18:56,210
My daughter is possessed!

364
00:18:56,230 --> 00:18:57,900
Why would we take her to the hospital?!

365
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:59,250
Master!

366
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:01,160
- Master, please help my child.
- You are all going to die!

367
00:19:01,190 --> 00:19:03,590
- Master! Please help my child.
- You are all going to die!

368
00:19:03,610 --> 00:19:05,830
Please help her again, Master!

369
00:19:05,850 --> 00:19:08,710
- Get a grip, ma'am!
- My heart is about to break, Master!

370
00:19:09,900 --> 00:19:10,820
Get a grip!

371
00:19:11,410 --> 00:19:13,680
Don't you see what's happening to her?!

372
00:19:13,700 --> 00:19:15,080
It's because I do!

373
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:17,400
I've raised her since birth!

374
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:20,270
Just by looking into her eyes,
I know that's not my daughter!

375
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:22,560
- Pleng...
- Fine!

376
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:25,500
If ghosts are real,
come get what you want from me!

377
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:27,210
Don't take it out on a child!

378
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:34,280
Pleng! My baby!

379
00:19:35,280 --> 00:19:36,950
Pleng!

380
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:39,330
Master, help!

381
00:19:39,350 --> 00:19:41,000
Sarge, call an ambulance!

382
00:19:42,670 --> 00:19:43,520
Sarge!

383
00:19:58,120 --> 00:19:59,210
Master!

384
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:02,500
I am not your child!

385
00:20:02,870 --> 00:20:03,710
Lieutenant,

386
00:20:03,730 --> 00:20:04,550
are you okay?

387
00:20:05,290 --> 00:20:06,460
I'm fine, Sarge.

388
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:10,000
Please let Master continue the ritual!

389
00:20:11,900 --> 00:20:13,780
Pleng, baby! Pleng!

390
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:16,120
Pleng!

391
00:20:16,380 --> 00:20:17,640
Master!

392
00:20:21,900 --> 00:20:23,320
Master...

393
00:20:23,350 --> 00:20:26,180
I'm begging you, please help her, Master.

394
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:28,040
Please...

395
00:20:28,960 --> 00:20:30,390
Ma'am,

396
00:20:31,600 --> 00:20:33,120
put this necklace on her.

397
00:20:33,140 --> 00:20:34,400
I am a cop.

398
00:20:34,430 --> 00:20:36,490
She will be safe.

399
00:20:36,510 --> 00:20:38,010
Please trust me, ma'am.

400
00:20:41,700 --> 00:20:42,840
Please do it.

401
00:20:48,590 --> 00:20:49,480
Pleng.

402
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:50,360
Pleng, dear.

403
00:20:50,380 --> 00:20:51,540
Pleng! Pleng.

404
00:20:53,380 --> 00:20:54,620
Pleng...

405
00:20:54,710 --> 00:20:56,160
May the deities protect you.

406
00:20:56,180 --> 00:20:58,180
Come back to Mommy, baby.

407
00:20:58,270 --> 00:20:59,820
Sarge, call an ambulance.

408
00:20:59,960 --> 00:21:01,110
Lieutenant, the ambulance is here!

409
00:21:01,130 --> 00:21:01,480
Alright.

410
00:21:01,500 --> 00:21:03,020
- Ma'am, let's go.
- Let's go.

411
00:21:04,610 --> 00:21:05,360
Alright.

412
00:21:05,510 --> 00:21:06,580
- Come on. Coming through.
- Kids,

413
00:21:06,600 --> 00:21:08,720
go back to class. Quick.

414
00:21:09,090 --> 00:21:10,120
Please move aside.

415
00:21:12,670 --> 00:21:14,600
I have never minded
that you do not believe in it,

416
00:21:15,110 --> 00:21:16,760
but do not interrupt my ritual.

417
00:21:16,820 --> 00:21:19,530
It is disrespectful
to my masters and my sacred arts.

418
00:21:23,300 --> 00:21:25,810
When afflictions come your way,

419
00:21:25,830 --> 00:21:27,680
even I cannot come to your rescue.

420
00:21:27,940 --> 00:21:29,610
Prove it to me, then.

421
00:21:29,790 --> 00:21:30,970
I'd also love to know

422
00:21:30,990 --> 00:21:32,100
if you could really banish ghosts

423
00:21:32,130 --> 00:21:34,210
if they were real.

424
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:48,530
[Phop Phra Police Station]

425
00:21:52,460 --> 00:21:54,140
"But do not interrupt my ritual.

426
00:21:54,170 --> 00:21:57,100
It is disrespectful
to my masters and my sacred arts."

427
00:21:58,100 --> 00:22:00,600
"When afflictions come your way,

428
00:22:00,630 --> 00:22:02,480
even I cannot come to your rescue."

429
00:22:14,210 --> 00:22:15,210
Sarge,

430
00:22:15,590 --> 00:22:16,590
how's the kid?

431
00:22:16,610 --> 00:22:17,440
Well...

432
00:22:17,460 --> 00:22:19,400
some bruises here and there.

433
00:22:19,810 --> 00:22:21,600
They've given her tranquilizers.

434
00:22:21,930 --> 00:22:22,990
She's in the hospital right now.

435
00:22:23,660 --> 00:22:24,600
Mm,

436
00:22:24,910 --> 00:22:25,910
that's good.

437
00:22:26,110 --> 00:22:26,820
Uh...

438
00:22:26,940 --> 00:22:27,600
By the way,

439
00:22:27,950 --> 00:22:28,900
how are you doing?

440
00:22:29,280 --> 00:22:30,280
Weren't you bitten?

441
00:22:30,510 --> 00:22:31,090
Wait...

442
00:22:31,780 --> 00:22:32,910
You've been slapped, too.

443
00:22:35,550 --> 00:22:36,890
But I do think you're special, Lieutenant.

444
00:22:38,530 --> 00:22:39,760
How so, Sarge?

445
00:22:40,060 --> 00:22:41,270
Ever since I moved here,

446
00:22:41,490 --> 00:22:42,280
this is the first time

447
00:22:42,640 --> 00:22:44,010
I've seen her

448
00:22:44,070 --> 00:22:45,160
slap someone that hard.

449
00:22:46,620 --> 00:22:47,620
So...

450
00:22:47,910 --> 00:22:51,230
what's this master of yours usually like?

451
00:22:51,320 --> 00:22:53,500
Could you tell me about her?

452
00:22:54,300 --> 00:22:55,300
This lady...

453
00:22:56,030 --> 00:22:57,030
she's the real one.

454
00:22:57,050 --> 00:22:58,000
She's legit.

455
00:22:58,700 --> 00:23:00,290
She's the best in all of Phop Phra.

456
00:23:00,710 --> 00:23:01,710
How so?

457
00:23:02,210 --> 00:23:03,210
She's beautiful

458
00:23:03,540 --> 00:23:04,420
and capable.

459
00:23:05,100 --> 00:23:06,320
When it comes to the Great Charm Yantras,

460
00:23:06,340 --> 00:23:07,500
she's second to none.

461
00:23:08,440 --> 00:23:09,490
She's that good.

462
00:23:11,310 --> 00:23:12,110
So...

463
00:23:12,130 --> 00:23:13,610
this master of yours

464
00:23:13,790 --> 00:23:15,720
doesn't have a single flaw?

465
00:23:16,280 --> 00:23:17,280
She doesn't.

466
00:23:18,100 --> 00:23:19,100
Though...

467
00:23:19,800 --> 00:23:21,220
she would only tattoo women

468
00:23:21,810 --> 00:23:23,240
because she dislikes men.

469
00:23:26,620 --> 00:23:27,620
How about

470
00:23:27,800 --> 00:23:29,500
I take you to her sanctum when we're free?

471
00:23:29,530 --> 00:23:30,720
Enough, Sarge.

472
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:33,450
If you're going to talk about
Master Bulan again,

473
00:23:33,470 --> 00:23:35,130
I'd rather not listen.

474
00:23:35,150 --> 00:23:38,080
I don't want to hear
about anything that can't be proven,

475
00:23:38,590 --> 00:23:41,900
especially her arts.

476
00:23:45,520 --> 00:23:47,370
Uh, Lieutenant.

477
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:48,400
Lieutenant, Lieutenant...

478
00:23:49,110 --> 00:23:49,890
You wanna eat it?

479
00:23:49,910 --> 00:23:50,600
Yes.

480
00:23:50,620 --> 00:23:51,620
It's all yours.

481
00:23:51,900 --> 00:23:52,710
Thank you.

482
00:24:03,730 --> 00:24:04,790
Sarge,

483
00:24:05,040 --> 00:24:05,770
how can you...

484
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:08,360
believe in something like this?

485
00:24:10,010 --> 00:24:12,120
Seeing is believing.

486
00:24:12,530 --> 00:24:14,100
You have to witness it yourself

487
00:24:14,460 --> 00:24:15,320
to realize it's real.

488
00:24:22,010 --> 00:24:23,610
My hands are real shaky.

489
00:24:25,730 --> 00:24:26,530
Mm.

490
00:24:29,040 --> 00:24:30,070
Which restaurant made this?

491
00:24:30,840 --> 00:24:31,910
I'll give them my business.

492
00:24:36,830 --> 00:24:37,600
Mm.

493
00:24:40,210 --> 00:24:41,220
Almost forgot.

494
00:24:43,800 --> 00:24:44,800
The chief

495
00:24:45,220 --> 00:24:46,880
left the key to the residence for you.

496
00:24:50,910 --> 00:24:51,700
By the way, you...

497
00:24:53,670 --> 00:24:55,140
don't have a home here

498
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:56,210
or...

499
00:24:56,800 --> 00:24:58,180
live with someone, right?

500
00:25:02,340 --> 00:25:03,640
No.

501
00:25:04,010 --> 00:25:06,980
I'm not living with anyone.

502
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:08,250
I sleep alone.

503
00:25:09,100 --> 00:25:10,050
Serves you right.

504
00:25:11,220 --> 00:25:12,100
Looking like that,

505
00:25:12,570 --> 00:25:14,670
someone like you will stay single
for the rest of your life.

506
00:25:15,740 --> 00:25:16,810
You're mid.

507
00:25:17,500 --> 00:25:18,450
Just stay single for life.

508
00:25:19,040 --> 00:25:20,230
Can't even compare to my wifey.

509
00:25:23,390 --> 00:25:25,000
Is your wife that pretty?

510
00:25:25,710 --> 00:25:26,570
What?!

511
00:25:27,190 --> 00:25:28,190
My wife?

512
00:25:29,180 --> 00:25:31,490
I thought my room
was just like any other room.

513
00:25:31,880 --> 00:25:33,430
But when my child walked past it,

514
00:25:33,460 --> 00:25:35,320
the kid said there was a god in my room

515
00:25:35,910 --> 00:25:37,170
because that's what my wife had cried out.

516
00:25:37,190 --> 00:25:38,610
"Oh, my God."

517
00:25:38,630 --> 00:25:39,690
"My God!"

518
00:25:40,170 --> 00:25:41,000
Wow....

519
00:25:41,670 --> 00:25:42,670
We go at it every day.

520
00:25:43,500 --> 00:25:44,390
grabbing by the hair,

521
00:25:44,410 --> 00:25:45,360
slapping,

522
00:25:45,380 --> 00:25:46,760
lamps to the head, and all that.

523
00:25:46,780 --> 00:25:47,330
Every darn day.

524
00:25:47,350 --> 00:25:48,430
Just cut it, Sarge.

525
00:26:12,980 --> 00:26:14,870
I am sorry, Mommy.

526
00:26:14,900 --> 00:26:16,470
But Mom...

527
00:26:16,880 --> 00:26:18,100
Keep still.

528
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:20,920
Do not feign concern.

529
00:26:22,980 --> 00:26:24,960
Let her see it for herself.

530
00:26:32,440 --> 00:26:35,610
[18 missing-person cases in Phop Phra]

531
00:26:37,520 --> 00:26:41,190
[Recurring incidents]

532
00:26:42,140 --> 00:26:45,660
[9 cases in Bangkok;
Pat is among the victims]

533
00:26:52,180 --> 00:26:54,520
["Master Bulan"]

534
00:26:55,090 --> 00:26:56,700
Master Bulan...

535
00:27:05,930 --> 00:27:07,460
["Master Bulan"]

536
00:27:13,430 --> 00:27:15,310
I have never minded
that you do not believe in it,

537
00:27:15,620 --> 00:27:17,320
but do not interrupt my ritual.

538
00:27:17,340 --> 00:27:20,050
It is disrespectful
to my sacred masters and my arts.

539
00:27:20,740 --> 00:27:23,240
When afflictions come your way,

540
00:27:23,270 --> 00:27:25,120
even I cannot come to your rescue.

541
00:27:42,610 --> 00:27:43,610
Peem...

542
00:29:16,020 --> 00:29:17,390
Where did that come from?

543
00:31:05,600 --> 00:31:08,800
I came from a faraway golden land,

544
00:31:09,070 --> 00:31:11,880
crossing the river
that flowed from the North.

545
00:31:13,110 --> 00:31:15,100
What a long odyssey.

546
00:31:27,590 --> 00:31:28,810
What the hell?

547
00:31:30,350 --> 00:31:31,790
You have challenged me.

548
00:31:35,010 --> 00:31:36,980
I will bring death upon you!

549
00:33:56,620 --> 00:33:59,200
My hair cascades.

550
00:34:01,110 --> 00:34:04,200
My eyes are filled with nothing but sorrow.

551
00:34:11,400 --> 00:34:12,970
From this breath on,

552
00:34:12,990 --> 00:34:15,670
we shall never be severed.

553
00:34:16,980 --> 00:34:18,590
You shall come with me!

554
00:34:37,940 --> 00:34:39,670
Never.

555
00:34:39,730 --> 00:34:41,710
Keep your nose out of it.

556
00:34:43,580 --> 00:34:45,620
Return to where you came from.

557
00:34:46,080 --> 00:34:48,260
I have been waiting for so long.

558
00:34:48,300 --> 00:34:49,150
Give her to me.

559
00:34:49,200 --> 00:34:51,500
Whichever ghost dares touch her,

560
00:34:52,700 --> 00:34:53,780
right then

561
00:34:54,290 --> 00:34:56,890
shall I burn its spirit to dust.

562
00:35:07,510 --> 00:35:08,200
Leave!

563
00:35:08,610 --> 00:35:12,900
♫Along with ghostly spirits
hounding relentlessly,♫

564
00:35:12,920 --> 00:35:17,640
♫May the maras be ravaged
and perish completely♫

565
00:35:17,660 --> 00:35:21,820
